      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "If no WHEN condition is true, CASE returns the ELSE result if one is given, or NULL if ELSE is omitted. A row with a NULL delivery_time_minutes also falls through to ELSE, because `NULL < 20` and `NULL < 40` are both not true. Omitting ELSE is valid but can silently produce NULLs in the output column.",
